---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="ebin Privacy Policy. Understand how we collect, handle, and protect your personal information during e-waste pickups in Bengaluru."
>
  
  <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal-900 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-eco-400 bg-charcoal-800 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-charcoal-700">
        Legal & Data Governance
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-charcoal-400">
        Last updated: November 2026 • Governing Bengaluru Operations
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-charcoal space-y-10 text-charcoal-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-charcoal-900 mb-3">1. Introduction & Scope</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>ebin</strong> ("we", "our", or "us"), we are committed to upholding the privacy and data rights of all individuals using our website and doorstep electronic waste collection services in Bengaluru, Karnataka. This Privacy Policy outlines our principles under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act (DPDP Act) and the Information Technology Act, 2000.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-charcoal-900 mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you interact with our website to schedule an e-waste pickup or submit an inquiry, we collect only the necessary information required for service delivery:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-2">
          <li><strong>Identity & Contact Details:</strong> Full name and mobile telephone number (for call/WhatsApp arrival coordination).</li>
          <li><strong>Bengaluru Location Data:</strong> Street address, apartment/building name, locality, and postal PIN code within Bruhat Bengaluru Mahanagara Palike (BBMP) boundaries.</li>
          <li><strong>Inventory Description:</strong> Item types, estimated device counts, and condition notes submitted during pickup requests.</li>
          <li><strong>Inquiry Communications:</strong> Email address and message contents provided through our general contact form.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-charcoal-900 mb-3">3. Purpose of Processing</h2>
        <p>Your personal information is used exclusively for the following operational reasons:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-2">
          <li>Routing and scheduling doorstep pickup logistics across Bengaluru neighborhoods.</li>
          <li>Contacting you via telephone or WhatsApp message to confirm collection time windows.</li>
          <li>Issuing digital collection receipts and confirming handover of e-waste materials.</li>
          <li>Complying with statutory reporting requirements under the Central Pollution Control Board (CPCB) E-Waste Management Rules.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-charcoal-900 mb-3">4. Customer Data on Hardware & Electronic Storage</h2>
        <p>
          We take hardware data privacy seriously:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-2">
          <li><strong>User Responsibility:</strong> Customers are strongly advised to back up all personal files and execute a factory reset or disk format on smartphones, computers, and storage media prior to pickup.</li>
          <li><strong>Certified Hardware Destruction:</strong> For non-functional or dead storage devices (hard disk drives, solid-state drives, memory chips), our authorized dismantling partners subject components to industrial shredding, crushing, or degaussing to ensure zero data recoverability.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-charcoal-900 mb-3">5. Absolute Commitment to Non-Disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell, lease, trade, or monetize your personal contact information with third-party advertisers, telemarketers, or commercial brokers. Data is shared strictly with our operational dispatchers and logistics partners solely for fulfilling your scheduled pickup.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-charcoal-900 mb-3">6. Data Retention & Security</h2>
        <p>
          Form submission records are stored in secure cloud systems protected by SSL encryption and modern access controls. Pickup records are retained only for as long as necessary to complete logistical fulfillment and maintain legal compliance under Indian e-waste manifesting mandates.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-charcoal-900 mb-3">7. Privacy Inquiries</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or wish to request the deletion or correction of your contact records, please reach out to our team using our web contact form at <a href="/contact/" class="text-eco-600 font-bold underline">/contact/</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
